#. module: sale_renting_crm
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_sale_renting_crm
msgid ""
"\n"
"This module adds a shortcut on one or several opportunity cases in the CRM.\n"
"===========================================================================\n"
"\n"
"This shortcut allows you to generate a rental order based on the selected "
"case.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"ໂມດູນນີ້ເພີ່ມປຸ່ມລັດໃສ່ໜຶ່ງ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍກໍລະນີໂອກາດໃນ CRM.\n"
"===========================================================================\n"
"\n"
"ປຸ່ມລັດນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສ້າງໃບສັ່ງເຊົ່າຕາມກໍລະນີທີ່ເລືອກ.\n"

